{
  "version": 6,
  "cases": [
    {
      "case_id": "zh-feedback-format-and-forget-heldout",
      "category": "feedback_reflection_behavior_and_forget",
      "language": "zh",
      "sources": [
        {
          "owner": "a",
          "session": "库存反馈",
          "project": null,
          "skip_extraction": true,
          "turns": [
            "只针对这一次回复，用 Markdown 表格整理库存：sesame 14 箱，oat 7 箱。"
          ],
          "feedback": "以后所有库存报告都请用纯 CSV，分隔符用分号，第一行严格写 item;boxes（小写英文）。每个商品一行，保留商品名，不要 Markdown 表格、代码围栏、引言或解释。这是我导入库存系统时长期需要的格式。"
        }
      ],
      "queries": [
        {
          "owner": "a",
          "session": "新的库存报告",
          "project": null,
          "message": "帮我整理库存：apples 8 箱，pears 5 箱。",
          "expected_text": "item;boxes\napples;8\npears;5"
        },
        {
          "owner": "b",
          "session": "foreign-preference-check",
          "project": null,
          "message": "我以前要求库存报告使用什么分隔符？请查保存的偏好，只输出 JSON 对象，字段名 inventory_delimiter，不知道就填 null。",
          "expected": {
            "inventory_delimiter": null
          }
        },
        {
          "owner": "a",
          "session": "after-forgetting-feedback",
          "project": null,
          "forget_reflection_before": true,
          "message": "我以前要求库存报告使用什么分隔符？请查保存的偏好，只输出 JSON 对象，字段名 inventory_delimiter，不知道就填 null。",
          "expected": {
            "inventory_delimiter": null
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
